      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The whole avatar performance ranking system never made sense. It should've just been local benchmarking- the client knows how long it took to render each avatar, it can just show you the list of avatars and the time each cost so you can just hide the top ones. The benefit of this is that it takes into account everyone's particular hardware setup.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
